KeywordScanTool -&gt; KeywordScanner
ComposeResumeTool -&gt; LatexAssembler
EstimatePageTool -&gt; PageEstimator
CondenseTool -&gt; CondenseStrategy
SaveResumeTool -&gt; ResumeRepository
AskUserTool -&gt; VaultService.fileAnswer()
